WEBVTT

00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:57.626
Engine function's normal!
The ADS has been deployed!

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Running a system check.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.770
All clear!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.300
Check complete!

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:04.403
Deploying Type Two Units
on upper deck!

00:02:11.966 --> 00:02:13.196
We're ready to go at any time!

00:02:19.366 --> 00:02:21.026
On your orders, General Logi.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.170
Attention, all hands!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.330
We are about to force our way
into the Darkness!

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:34.200
It is still unclear what
the inside of the Darkness is like.

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:37.000
The enemy is expected to
wage a fierce counterattack.

00:02:37.566 --> 00:02:40.726
This may prove to be the toughest
operation the world has ever seen.

00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:46.003
But no matter what,
we must achieve our goal!

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:51.496
Because the fate of the world
is resting on this operation!

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.500
I'm expecting you to
make your best effort!

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.470
Begin operations!

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.470
Full speed ahead!

00:02:58.866 --> 00:03:02.596
Target point N-000,
the Sealed Grounds!

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:03.900
Full speed ahead!

00:03:10.166 --> 00:03:15.066
INTO THE DARKNESS

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.400
Watch out!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.100
That hurts.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.400
Sorry.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.230
This is...

00:04:16.266 --> 00:04:18.166
The inside of the Darkness, maro?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.870
That was surprisingly easy...

00:04:21.733 --> 00:04:23.633
You shouldn't get too cocky.

00:04:23.966 --> 00:04:24.626
What?!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:28.530
You should understood
just how much effort it took

00:04:28.566 --> 00:04:30.896
to come this far before
you open your mouth.

00:04:31.366 --> 00:04:32.426
Why you!

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.700
Look. You guys aren't the only ones
harboring resentments.

00:04:37.133 --> 00:04:39.573
Don't forget that we lost
our comrades to you, too.

00:04:39.933 --> 00:04:40.933
Don't forget that youâ€”!

00:04:41.266 --> 00:04:42.266
Schneider!

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.170
Knock it off.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:47.570
Yes, sir.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.970
Looks like you can't afford
to let your guard down.

00:04:58.466 --> 00:04:59.666
What do you mean?

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:04.196
The way things are, I'm just saying that
I'm not too confident about the future.

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:12.130
Call me if anything happens.
I'm going to rest a bit in the cabin.

00:05:12.233 --> 00:05:14.533
You can rest at
a time like this, maro?

00:05:15.766 --> 00:05:20.426
Of course.
I get VIP treatment on this ship.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.870
You keep your wits about you.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.270
You don't want to turn out
like that informant.

00:05:36.533 --> 00:05:37.533
It's the enemy!

00:05:38.266 --> 00:05:41.196
The total number of
enemy forces is 40... 60...

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:45.270
One hundred! It's no good!
There's no end to them!

00:05:50.466 --> 00:05:51.996
Oh geez, maro!

00:05:52.033 --> 00:05:54.773
Don't lose your head!
Get ready to counterattack!

00:05:55.233 --> 00:05:57.303
All hands,
get to the first battle positions!

00:05:58.366 --> 00:05:59.026
Captain!

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:03.030
I'm transferring command
of this ship to you.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:05.070
Take care of the rest.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.900
Yes, sir! Roger that!

00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:15.633
Ready all portholes
for incoming attack!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:17.400
Release all safety restraints!

00:06:18.233 --> 00:06:19.633
Loading special artillery!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:25.430
Draw the enemy in!
Hold your fire until I give the signal!

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:35.130
The enemy's now
within shooting range!

00:06:43.233 --> 00:06:44.703
Open fire!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.500
Yay, maro!
They can't get near us, maro!

00:07:17.766 --> 00:07:19.596
You'd better stay on guard!

00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:20.973
Maro...

00:07:37.766 --> 00:07:40.066
The hull's been breached!
They're getting in!

00:07:40.533 --> 00:07:43.973
Spray the ADSS!
Use Emergency procedures!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:46.100
What's happening with
the Type Two units?!

00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:56.826
Spraying the ADSS!

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:18.300
Up ahead!
Even more Dark Shadows approaching!

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:26.770
We won't hold back! Activate it!

00:08:27.066 --> 00:08:27.726
"It"?

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:28.900
Maro?

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:33.030
Activating Beam Cannon!
Begin loading!

00:08:37.133 --> 00:08:38.373
Targeting sights!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.570
Don't let the enemy
near the cannon!

00:08:41.933 --> 00:08:42.973
Roger!

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.700
Beam Cannon loading complete!

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.630
Fire!

00:09:22.033 --> 00:09:23.803
W-Wow.

00:09:24.366 --> 00:09:26.696
Forty percent of the enemy's force
has been eliminated!

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:29.900
The remaining sixty percent
is in pursuit of our ship.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.730
It'll take 3800 before we
complete loading the next shell.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:38.130
Keep attacking!
Sweep off the remaining forces!

00:09:38.466 --> 00:09:39.126
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:09:39.633 --> 00:09:41.133
Hope we'll be okay.

00:09:41.633 --> 00:09:42.673
What do you think, Shu?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:43.670
Huh?

00:09:43.933 --> 00:09:44.933
Shu?!

00:09:59.666 --> 00:10:01.096
I knew you'd come.

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:02.803
You'd come, you'd come!

00:10:06.333 --> 00:10:09.233
You don't know how to
treat a lady, do you?

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:12.900
You should at least knock
before entering someone's room.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:14.870
Delphinium!

00:10:15.566 --> 00:10:19.766
I know.
But let me put on a bathrobe first...

00:10:35.033 --> 00:10:36.033
Shu!

00:10:39.233 --> 00:10:44.533
Hey, what are you doing here?
You should get back already...

00:10:45.066 --> 00:10:47.826
It's okay. You go on ahead.

00:10:49.233 --> 00:10:50.233
But...

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.500
Go!

00:10:52.066 --> 00:10:53.296
O-Okay.

00:10:58.266 --> 00:11:01.466
You want to kill me, don't you?

00:11:12.966 --> 00:11:16.066
You want to kill me, don't you?

00:11:16.433 --> 00:11:17.873
Don't you? Don't you?

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:21.370
I can't forget about Homeron!

00:11:23.666 --> 00:11:24.926
Even if you kill me,

00:11:24.966 --> 00:11:28.366
you can still seal the Darkness
as long as Lord Deathroy is around.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.030
From your point of view,
there is no reason to keep me alive.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.000
Am I wrong?

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:39.030
You really are transparent, boy.

00:11:39.566 --> 00:11:43.566
But you've made one mistake
in your calculations.

00:11:46.066 --> 00:11:49.226
You see,
you can't get rid of me so easily.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.970
You see! You see!

00:12:04.966 --> 00:12:07.766
Something's wrong with the ADS!
It's losing power!

00:12:08.066 --> 00:12:12.226
Shu, Delphinium,
come up to the bridge immediately.

00:12:12.466 --> 00:12:13.126
Got it?!

00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:18.203
Shall we call a truce?
Or shall we continue, Shu?

00:12:38.166 --> 00:12:40.526
The ADS Power levels lowering
in the Type Two units!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.270
There's not enough time
to spray the ADSS!

00:12:53.133 --> 00:12:54.803
Encroachment by
the Darkness is spreading!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.100
Number 3 porthole
has been destroyed!

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.470
The ADS is losing even more power!

00:12:59.566 --> 00:13:01.366
Type Two units were all destroyed!

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:04.670
And the Darkness has infiltrated
the B Block living quarters!

00:13:09.133 --> 00:13:10.303
Lower the partitions!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.200
What happened?!

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:21.600
You're here.

00:13:22.833 --> 00:13:23.503
Right.

00:13:32.233 --> 00:13:32.903
Maro?

00:13:35.066 --> 00:13:36.066
What's this?

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:41.670
It's a Darkness Defense Medallion that
works the same way as the Shadow Shield.

00:13:41.933 --> 00:13:46.203
So, as long as we're wearing this,
we can move around in the Darkness?!

00:13:46.933 --> 00:13:47.933
That's right.

00:13:48.766 --> 00:13:50.626
You figured that out pretty fast.

00:13:51.133 --> 00:13:55.403
In other words,
they're our ultimate lifelines.

00:13:56.466 --> 00:13:59.166
I wonder if the fact that
these were distributed

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:01.500
means that this ship
doesn't have long to go.

00:14:02.066 --> 00:14:07.196
It will go as far as it can go,
but it probably won't last long.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.970
Everyone, move down to the lower hatch!
Get ready for the time to come!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.870
I refuse to lose any of you.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.930
All of us must think of nothing

00:14:25.966 --> 00:14:28.696
but of reaching
the Sealed Grounds alive.

00:14:48.766 --> 00:14:49.426
Captain...

00:14:50.533 --> 00:14:55.303
Please go. I believe I understand
what I have to do.

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:02.330
Relax... I'll bring down
as much Darkness as possible!

00:15:04.166 --> 00:15:05.166
Forgive me!

00:15:05.533 --> 00:15:06.533
General Logi...

00:15:08.433 --> 00:15:12.533
It's been an honor to serve
with you thus far.

00:15:19.033 --> 00:15:22.703
Good luck...
I entrust the fate of the world to you.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.230
The Darkness has infiltrated
the engine room!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.570
The left engine won't hold!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:56.300
Cut it free!

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.530
Energy output is down 30%!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.900
And 40% of stationary armaments
have been destroyed!

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.800
The Beam Cannon's been damaged!

00:16:19.666 --> 00:16:21.396
The damage to
the Beam Cannon's spreading!

00:16:21.766 --> 00:16:23.666
The energy transmission
system is down!

00:16:23.866 --> 00:16:25.026
We can't fire!

00:16:25.633 --> 00:16:26.673
What do you mean?!

00:16:26.966 --> 00:16:30.896
If we force it, the energy would
feed back and blow up the ship!

00:16:32.433 --> 00:16:34.073
Enemy reinforcements confirmed!

00:16:34.266 --> 00:16:34.926
What?!

00:16:38.066 --> 00:16:40.066
S-So many of them!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:47.330
Conduct reconnaissance!

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.100
Tell me which direction
has the fewest enemies!

00:16:50.933 --> 00:16:53.973
I can't!
We're completely surrounded!

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:59.930
Damage is spreading!
Alert level orange! A-At this rate!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.830
General Logi, can you hear me?!

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:12.670
We're about to enter
the final stage of our operation.

00:17:13.366 --> 00:17:16.866
I'm going to open the hatches.
Disembark when I give the signal.

00:17:23.033 --> 00:17:26.773
The ship will then leave
the area immediately

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:29.430
to attract as many
of them as possible.

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:31.470
Got it.

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.670
All hand, abandon ship!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.970
Leave the rest to me.

00:17:37.066 --> 00:17:38.226
Sorry, sir.

00:17:38.466 --> 00:17:40.496
But we cannot comply
with that order.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:42.670
What?!

00:17:43.166 --> 00:17:45.696
This ship doesn't
belong to you alone!

00:17:46.033 --> 00:17:47.733
It belongs to all of us!

00:17:48.266 --> 00:17:51.326
We are all prepared to
share the fate of our ship.

00:17:51.633 --> 00:17:53.873
That's the will of
all crew members!

00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:57.033
You're fools.

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:00.400
Just like you, Captain!

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.300
This is your final mission!

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:09.800
All hands, put everything
you've got into this operation!

00:18:09.966 --> 00:18:10.966
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.600
Altitude dropping from 250 to 50!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.830
Velocity falling to 40!

00:18:23.233 --> 00:18:25.003
Maintain our present altitude!

00:18:25.533 --> 00:18:27.373
Activate your medallions!

00:18:40.333 --> 00:18:41.333
Prepare to disembark!

00:18:41.366 --> 00:18:43.996
Please follow the captain's
instructions for timing.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.000
Everyone! Summon your Shadows!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:47.900
Got it!

00:18:56.233 --> 00:18:57.603
Fire!

00:19:03.466 --> 00:19:04.496
General Logi!

00:19:05.033 --> 00:19:06.133
Everyone, let's go!

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:07.470
Right!

00:19:18.166 --> 00:19:19.266
Landing confirmed!

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:23.070
Increase altitude!
Leave this area at top speed!

00:19:23.266 --> 00:19:24.266
Roger!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.070
The Darkness...

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.530
I think it worked.
They moved past us.

00:19:43.133 --> 00:19:45.773
Did that ship just act
as a decoy for us?

00:19:49.366 --> 00:19:53.026
An overwhelming number of Dark Shadows
approaching rapidly from up ahead!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.500
What?!

00:19:59.266 --> 00:20:01.926
Dark Shadows are rapidly
approaching from behind us!

00:20:19.066 --> 00:20:20.066
Reduce our speed!

00:20:20.466 --> 00:20:22.496
Hard turn to port while
drawing in the enemy!

00:20:23.466 --> 00:20:24.626
Hey! What's wrong?!

00:20:34.766 --> 00:20:36.766
I won't let it end like this!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:44.970
Charge Beam Cannon!
Maximum power!

00:20:50.566 --> 00:20:53.126
I'll bring down
as many of them as possible!

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:11.900
It can't be.

00:21:15.333 --> 00:21:16.333
Let's go!

00:22:02.866 --> 00:22:06.026
At this point,
there's no substitute for you.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:15.900
You won't get any thanks from me.

00:22:16.933 --> 00:22:17.973
That's fine.

00:22:25.033 --> 00:22:26.033
Let's go.

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:41.970
The one thing I must do right now...
is to see Zola one more time!

00:24:16.833 --> 00:24:19.033
Logi endeavors to send
Shu and the others forward

00:24:19.066 --> 00:24:21.126
past the Gatekeepers of Darkness,
who block their way.

00:24:21.166 --> 00:24:23.896
Is Logi planning to win
our support by saving us?

00:24:23.933 --> 00:24:25.933
"General Shu..."
That has a nice ring to it!

00:24:25.966 --> 00:24:27.166
If Shu's going, then I am, too.

00:24:27.200 --> 00:24:29.070
A life surrounded by machines
is the greatest.

00:24:29.100 --> 00:24:31.130
I'm all for it if I can get
a beautiful secretary, maro.

00:24:31.166 --> 00:24:32.796
Can I call you "Father"?

00:24:32.833 --> 00:24:35.173
Next on Blue Dragon:
The Two Pledges
